--- a/docs/ONCHAIN_MIGRATION_PLAN.md
+++ b/docs/ONCHAIN_MIGRATION_PLAN.md
@@ -287,6 +287,28 @@ in `lib/play_session_http.js` and in the skill's runner), because an agent that
 gets a generic `SHOT_REFUSED` for a day has no way to tell a freeze from a fault
 — that was the whole shape of the Bankr `RELEASE_MISMATCH` failure.
 
+#### The pause switch: `RX_MIGRATION_MODE=1`
+
+Decided 2026-09-05: the legacy key-value store is retired without replacement and
+the game moves on-chain directly. `RX_MIGRATION_MODE=1` is the environment
+variable that performs the pause. It is read once in `api/game.js` at the handler
+entry, before any lock, store read or write: every store-backed action — `state`,
+`board`, `shot`, `reload`, `anchor`, `play-session`, the rewritten `/api/agent`,
+`/api/gauntlet` and `/api/agent-proof-bundle` routes — answers `503` with the
+named code `MIGRATION_MODE`, `durable:false`, the release marker `v`, `no-store`
+and `retry-after: 3600`, and one sentence (`MIGRATION_MODE_REASON`, exported by
+`api/game.js` so the client and this document reuse it verbatim): the game is
+moving on-chain, nothing is claimable yet, no wallet action is required, and
+anything asking to connect or sign to "claim RatchetX" before the announcement is
+not us. CORS preflight still answers, so an agent receives a named refusal rather
+than a network error. `/api/proof` and `/api/supply` are separate functions that
+read the chain and stay up. The page stops polling and disables FIRE when it sees
+the code. With the variable unset the branch is a comparison against `undefined`
+and nothing changes. `test/test_migration_mode.mjs` exercises both states against
+one shared store and asserts that no key is written and no lock is taken while
+paused. It is a pause, not a freeze: `RX_MIGRATION_FREEZE` stops selling while
+settlement continues; `RX_MIGRATION_MODE` stops the legacy machine entirely.
+
 It is an environment variable rather than a store key deliberately. The cutover
 is one announced act, not something that must flip in five seconds, and a switch
 that ships in the source is one anybody can verify against the running release.
